(187, 6, 'Level 9', 'STRINGS AND DECISIONS', 'The Slicing Blade', 'A blade slices a piece out of a word. The substring(beginIndex, endIndex) method extracts a substring starting from beginIndex. The character at endIndex is not included, so substring(0, 3) takes the characters at index 0, 1 and 2. For "SEPTEMBER" that gives "SEP".

