(189, 6, 'Level 11', 'STRINGS AND DECISIONS', 'The Start and End Gates', 'Two gates check how a word begins and how it ends. The startsWith() method returns true if the string begins with the string specified, and endsWith() returns true if the string ends with it. "SEPTEMBER" starts with "SEP" and ends with "BER".

