(181, 1, 'Which code stores whether string1 exactly equals string3 in a boolean named same?', 'String string1 = "Java"; String string3 = "java"; boolean same = string1.equals(string3);', 'String string1 = "Java"; String string3 = "java"; boolean same = string1.equal(string3);', 'String string1 = "Java"; String string3 = "java"; boolean same = string1.equals();', 'String string1 = "Java"; String string3 = "java"; int same = string1.equals(string3);'),
