(189, 1, 'Which code checks whether myString starts with "SEP" and ends with "BER"?', 'String myString = "SEPTEMBER"; boolean begins = myString.startsWith("SEP"); boolean ends = myString.endsWith("BER");', 'String myString = "SEPTEMBER"; boolean begins = myString.endsWith("SEP"); boolean ends = myString.startsWith("BER");', 'String myString = "SEPTEMBER"; boolean begins = myString.startsWith("SEP"); boolean ends = myString.endWith("BER");', 'String myString = "SEPTEMBER"; boolean begins = myString.startsWith("SEP"); String ends = myString.endsWith("BER");'),
