(191, 1, 'Which code prints Congratulations! only when grade is greater than 60?', 'int grade = 68; if (grade > 60) { System.out.println("Congratulations!"); }', 'int grade = 68; if grade > 60 { System.out.println("Congratulations!"); }', 'int grade = 68; if (grade = 60) { System.out.println("Congratulations!"); }', 'int grade = 68; if (grade > 60) { System.out.println("Congratulations!") }'),
