(196, 1, 'Which code uses a switch on grade with a case 100 that prints Excellent! and breaks?', 'int grade = 100; switch (grade) { case 100: System.out.println("Excellent!"); break; }', 'int grade = 100; switch (grade) { case 100; System.out.println("Excellent!"); break; }', 'int grade = 100; switch (grade) { case 100: System.out.println("Excellent!"); break }', 'int grade = 100; switch grade { case 100: System.out.println("Excellent!"); break; }'),
